@startuml
title Connect4 - State Machine

[*] --> IN_PROGRESS : createInitialState()

IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : applyAction()\n[valid move, no winner,\nboard not full]

IN_PROGRESS --> P1_WIN : applyAction()\n[Player1 gets 4 in a row]

IN_PROGRESS --> P2_WIN : applyAction()\n[Player2 gets 4 in a row]

IN_PROGRESS --> TIE : applyAction()\n[board full, no winner]

P1_WIN --> [*]
P2_WIN --> [*]
TIE --> [*]

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  playerTurn alternates between
  PLAYER1 and PLAYER2 on each
  successful applyAction()
end note
@enduml